WEBVTT

00:50:28.958 --> 00:50:30.309
RR: No, it's OK.

00:50:30.333 --> 00:50:33.708
CA: Can you read the question
on the screen, Rashad?

00:50:34.708 --> 00:50:36.958
RR: Oh, I heard that, I heard you.

00:50:37.625 --> 00:50:41.833
WPR: Yes, I think it might just be
my mic is having some issues here.

00:50:43.292 --> 00:50:46.268
"Is there a possibility
that white supremacy will get stronger

00:50:46.292 --> 00:50:48.083
if we don't seize this opportunity."

00:50:52.667 --> 00:50:55.393
Yes, absolutely yes.

00:50:55.417 --> 00:50:58.351
You know, to be clear, right,

00:50:58.375 --> 00:51:02.309
if we don't have the right diagnosis
of white supremacy,